// Chorus  [audioEffect] — Tracktion's chorus rebuilt as a graph, so its knobs can be AUTOMATED: the plugin
// keeps them as plain state, which no curve reaches. Its Mix is the module's `mix:`, the engine's own stage.
// Its DSP is described in jsdsp.ts beside this file, not compiled into the engine.
plugin({ type: "jsdsp", name: "Chorus" })
params({ Depth: 3, Speed: 1, Width: 0.5 })
// One delay swept between 20 and 20 + Depth ms by a sine at Speed Hz, the right channel Width half a cycle ahead, blended under the dry by the module's mix (0.5, the plugin's default) on the engine's equal-power curve.
